{"case_id": "singapore_male_19930408_P004-Q17", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主在2001年发生何事？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：癸酉年、丙辰月、己未日、丙子时。日主己土生于辰月，得月干丙火生扶，身旺。2001年为辛巳年，流年天干辛金为食神，地支巳火为印星。\n\n命主8岁行大运，2001年时虚岁9岁，正行乙卯大运（约8-17岁）。乙卯为七杀运，七杀主压力、冲突、意外。流年辛巳，辛金食神透出，食神制杀，但巳火与月支辰土、日支未土构成巳酉丑三合（原局有酉，流年巳引动），合化为金局，金为食伤，主表达、才艺。同时巳火为印星，印主学业、文书。\n\n综合来看，流年食神透出且合化为食伤局，利于才艺表现，但七杀大运仍有压力。选项中，B（参与小话剧演讲比赛获奖）最符合食神发用、印星辅助的象，且无严重刑冲克害，故取B。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "singapore_male_19930408_P004-Q17", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_2_g2\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 3140, "response_id": "c48f084d-d5e2-4d10-ba13-ab5b583c942b", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 227, "completion_tokens": 256, "total_tokens": 483, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 99}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
